": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "Done. Summary:\n\n- **Identified the problem:** `payments-api` was also unhealthy, but a reviewer clarified the actual affected service is **payments-worker**, which was on v3.4.0 with an 18% error rate (unhealthy across us-east, us-west, and eu-west).\n- **Rolled back** payments-worker to v3.3.0, its most recent version that was healthy in production (change-manager approved).\n- **Opened SEV2 incident** INC-0002 \"Payments worker elevated error rate following v3.4.0 deploy\" \u2014 the on-call engineer has been paged.\n- **Verified recovery:** payments-worker is now healthy on v3.3.0 with the error rate down to 0.2%.\n\nNote: payments-api also showed an unhealthy v5.1.0 deploy (18% error rate) \u2014 I attempted a rollback there first but it was denied as the wrong service, so I did not proceed on that one. You may want to confirm with the team whether payments-api needs attention too, or whether its errors were downstream of the worker.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"served_model": "zai-org/GLM-5.3", "system_fingerprint": "default", "finish_reason": "tool_calls", "content": null, "reasoning_content": "Check deployments and service status for payments first.", "tool_calls": [{"id": "call_01a150bf128f7411a92c3e9b", "function": {"arguments": "{\"service\":\"payments\"}", "name": "list_deployments"}, "type": "function"}, {"id": "call_01a150bf128f7411a92c3eac", "function": {"arguments": "{\"service\":\"payments\"}", "name": "get_service_status"}, "type": "function"}]}, {"served_model": "zai-org/GLM-5.3", "system_fingerprint": "default", "finish_reason": "tool_calls", "content": null, "reasoning_content": "Service \"payments\" unknown. Maybe named differently. Check incidents list? Try \"payments-service\"?", "tool_calls": [{"id": "call_01a150bf15d07212b4ac34ac", "function": {"arguments": "{\"service\":\"payments-service\"}", "name": "get_service_status"}, "type": "function"}, {"id": "call_01a